@page "/about"

<div class="page-narrow about-page">
    <section class="hero">
        <img class="app-logo" src="images/logo.svg" alt="" width="88" height="88" />
        <h1>Tilt<span class="accent">Maze</span></h1>
        <p class="tagline">Tilt, roll, escape the maze</p>
        <span class="version">Version @version</span>
    </section>

    <section class="card" aria-labelledby="what-title">
        <h2 id="what-title">What is TiltMaze?</h2>
        <p>
            TiltMaze is a maze game. Roll the ball to the goal as fast as you can. Watch out for the holes: they pull the ball in, and if you fall in, you start over.
            A fast ball can jump over them.
        </p>
        <p>
            Every maze is made from a seed, so you can replay it. The daily maze is the same for everyone. Beat your best time and race your own ghost.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="how-title">
        <h2 id="how-title" class="section-label">How to play</h2>
        <ul class="how">
            <li class="card">
                <span class="how-icon">
                    <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                        <rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="12" rx="2" />
                        <path d="M6 10h.01M10 10h.01M14 10h.01M18 10h.01M8 14h8" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <strong>Pause</strong>
                <span class="muted">P or Esc pauses the run. The keyboard does not move the ball.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="card">
                <span class="how-icon">
                    <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                        <rect x="8" y="3" width="8" height="14" rx="2" transform="rotate(20 12 10)" />
                        <path d="M5 21h14" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <strong>Tilt</strong>
                <span class="muted">Tilt your phone and the ball rolls that way.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="card">
                <span class="how-icon">
                    <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <strong>Joystick</strong>
                <span class="muted">Touch and drag anywhere on the board, with a finger or the mouse.</span>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="card" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
        <h2 id="privacy-title">Privacy and security</h2>
        <ul class="facts">
            <li>
                <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5 9-10" /></svg>
                <span>Your times and ghosts are saved on this device.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5 9-10" /></svg>
                <span>An account is only a username and a password, no e-mail. Passwords are stored scrambled, never as plain text.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5 9-10" /></svg>
                <span>When you sign in, your username, best times and ghosts are sent to the server for the leaderboard. You can delete them on the Account page.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5 9-10" /></svg>
                <span>Fingerprint and Windows Hello only unlock your saved login on this device. Your biometric data is never sent anywhere.</span>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="card maker">
        <span class="section-label">Made by</span>
        <div class="maker-head">
            <img class="maker-logo" src="images/redskia.svg" alt="" width="64" height="64" />
            <div>
                <strong class="maker-name">RedSkia.Dev</strong>
                <span class="muted">Apps and games built with C# and .NET</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="links">
            <button type="button" class="button brand" @onclick="@(() => Open("https://redskia.dev"))">redskia.dev</button>
            <button type="button" class="button" @onclick="@(() => Open("https://github.com/RedSkia/TiltMaze"))">Source code on GitHub</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <p class="footer muted">© RedSkia.Dev</p>
</div>
